WEBVTT

00:00:01.140 --> 00:00:03.380
He's dancing?

00:00:10.670 --> 00:00:11.820
I can feel the rhythm!

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:14.550
It's the color of wind again!

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:18.280
The wind!

00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:33.110
Any more?

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:36.560
That unit...

00:00:47.050 --> 00:00:48.810
Pilot! Are you okay?

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:51.140
Who are you?

00:00:55.130 --> 00:00:56.570
Where are the Walkure?

00:00:56.740 --> 00:00:57.980
Where's Mikumo?

00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:05.370
<i>Mind on the edge, at the boiling point{girigiri mind genkaiten nara}</i>

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>You can paint me your color{nurikaete ii}</i>

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:15.200
<i>Destruction and rebirth is my life{hakai to saisei kara watashi wa dekiru}</i>

00:01:08.440 --> 00:01:11.050
Y-Yack...

00:01:14.780 --> 00:01:15.970
Song...

00:01:19.670 --> 00:01:21.180
The Walkure, huh?

00:01:22.260 --> 00:01:24.390
White knight! Terminate operation.

00:01:24.390 --> 00:01:25.670
Return to the Branch.

00:01:25.670 --> 00:01:27.990
Why? We can win this fight!

00:01:27.990 --> 00:01:29.370
We have the data we need.

00:01:29.370 --> 00:01:30.880
This is an order.

00:01:32.570 --> 00:01:43.190
<i>It is love that brings me back to life{ai suru koto de umarekawaru}</i>

00:01:32.810 --> 00:01:33.740
Roger.

00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:37.730
All units return to the Branch.

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:38.450
Roger...

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:56.240
<i>It is love that I need, coming back to you{ai saretakute ikite kaeru}</i>

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:51.590
They're backing off?

00:01:51.950 --> 00:01:54.050
Were they just testing us?

00:01:59.470 --> 00:02:01.470
May the sea of stars

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:03.510
be blessed by the goddess!

00:02:08.340 --> 00:02:11.060
<i>We've only got one shot at love,</i>

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:13.920
<i>so let's have fun inside of you</i>

00:02:13.920 --> 00:02:17.780
<i>Let's share a selfish kiss</i>

00:02:23.160 --> 00:02:28.580
<i>The petals of this flower fall in the wind</i>

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:34.050
<i>The stars are more than I could count</i>

00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:37.590
<i>It doesn't matter if I blame it all on you,</i>

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:40.340
<i>swallowing back my tears</i>

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:45.180
<i>I can't tell anyone about how my heart races</i>

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:47.390
<i>Reach out</i>

00:02:46.310 --> 00:02:48.730
<i>Until it all breaks apart</i>

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:50.640
<i>Reach out</i>

00:02:49.090 --> 00:02:51.870
<i>Until you can take flight</i>

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:53.360
<i>To the ends</i>

00:02:51.930 --> 00:02:54.190
<i>Deep in my heart</i>

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:55.980
<i>Of time</i>

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:56.780
<i>There is a prayer</i>

00:02:56.780 --> 00:02:59.700
<i>Just feel, just believe</i>

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:03.800
<i>and speed through it all</i>

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:06.950
<i>We've only got one shot at love,</i>

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:09.710
<i>so let's have fun inside of you</i>

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:15.290
<i>Let's share a kiss faster than light, just wait for me</i>

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:17.920
<i>My body almost forgot</i>

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:20.930
<i>My heart kept beating loudly</i>

00:03:20.930 --> 00:03:26.360
<i>Escape your chains, they're all but a dream</i>

00:03:26.360 --> 00:03:33.070
<i>Tear them off and come at me, just like that</i>

00:03:44.690 --> 00:03:48.000
If you're injured or not feeling well, please come here!

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:52.170
You, civilian!

00:03:53.860 --> 00:03:55.480
Hey, thanks for saving me.

00:03:59.080 --> 00:04:00.420
What the hell was that for?!

00:04:00.650 --> 00:04:02.980
Do you realize you just hijacked a military unit?

00:04:02.980 --> 00:04:07.140
Make one mistake and the whole operation falls apart, putting the city at risk!

00:04:07.730 --> 00:04:09.810
Even the smallest lapse can cost you your life!

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:11.980
Calm down! Listen to me firs—

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:14.710
Don't tread on the battlefield so lightly!

00:04:15.820 --> 00:04:17.590
You screwed up too!

00:04:18.140 --> 00:04:19.320
I saw you.

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:22.380
Earlier, you were off beat when you took off!

00:04:23.710 --> 00:04:25.990
Aren't <i>you</i> the one taking this too lightly?

00:04:26.580 --> 00:04:29.870
Mirage, what are you doing? We're leaving.

00:04:30.960 --> 00:04:32.910
Please report any complaints to my superiors.

00:04:33.150 --> 00:04:34.280
Excuse me.

00:04:47.740 --> 00:04:48.930
See you!

00:04:48.930 --> 00:04:50.560
Mikumo!

00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:54.950
I'll be at your audition next week!

00:04:55.470 --> 00:04:58.520
I'm gonna sing next to you!

00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:00.170
That girl...

00:05:00.170 --> 00:05:01.190
Yeah.

00:05:01.190 --> 00:05:03.530
We could hear you sing!

00:05:04.970 --> 00:05:07.780
Your singing is so cute!

00:05:07.780 --> 00:05:10.740
It resonated inside my chest. It felt nice.

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:11.700
It felt great!

00:05:12.990 --> 00:05:15.230
Oh my gosh...

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:17.570
Pershaps, she may...

00:05:19.730 --> 00:05:21.300
We're looking forward to see you

00:05:21.300 --> 00:05:22.830
on Ragna!

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:27.260
Yup!

00:05:34.170 --> 00:05:36.730
I sang along them for real, huh?

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:43.070
With Walkure... And Mikumo...

00:05:47.810 --> 00:05:50.380
Get those on the launch pad on the double!

00:05:50.380 --> 00:05:51.780
Delta Leader, done.

00:05:52.510 --> 00:05:55.540
Every video signal is jammed.

00:05:55.860 --> 00:05:57.690
We have no matching data either.

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:02.590
Nice performance out there.

00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:04.960
Want some Barrette shredded jellyfish?

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:06.790
I'll pass.

00:06:07.580 --> 00:06:09.720
Thanks for the help earlier, Messer.

00:06:10.630 --> 00:06:11.930
Just my duty.

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:14.530
What did you want to show us?

00:06:14.530 --> 00:06:15.520
This.

00:06:20.460 --> 00:06:22.530
What's that shining on her head?

00:06:22.530 --> 00:06:25.010
A rune. She's a Windermerean.

00:06:25.690 --> 00:06:28.160
She has a fold receptor factor?

00:06:28.160 --> 00:06:31.080
Yes. And it's abnormally high, to boot.

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:34.220
Even Mikumo's output reacted to her voice.

00:06:35.510 --> 00:06:38.160
And this is what you asked for.

00:06:40.940 --> 00:06:43.570
Hayate Immelmann, huh?

00:06:57.440 --> 00:06:59.390
I can't accept this, Lord Keith.

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:01.510
I request an explanation.

00:07:01.510 --> 00:07:02.440
Likewise.

00:07:03.760 --> 00:07:04.970
Understood.

00:07:06.450 --> 00:07:08.780
Roid, why did you stop us?

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:10.650
You'd completed your objectives.

00:07:11.270 --> 00:07:14.240
There was no change in plans.

00:07:14.380 --> 00:07:17.100
We should strike when we have a chance.

00:07:17.630 --> 00:07:20.430
We have no time to spare.

00:07:22.600 --> 00:07:26.710
I know. We can't forget about Lord Heinz's health.

00:07:28.520 --> 00:07:30.710
Open the windows every now and then.

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:33.580
There's no wind in here.

00:07:47.540 --> 00:07:50.990
Planet Ragna  Barrette City

00:07:58.100 --> 00:08:01.580
Delight your taste buds with Ragna's specialty: the Barrette jellyfish!

00:08:06.320 --> 00:08:07.960
So cute!

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:08.840
Totally!

00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:15.220
Wow, we're on Ragna!

00:08:16.360 --> 00:08:18.930
There are so many sparkly sounds!

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:25.860
Ugh... Damn mercats all over the place...

00:08:25.860 --> 00:08:27.960
What are you doing here?

00:08:29.060 --> 00:08:32.660
I came to see you fail the auditions.

00:08:32.660 --> 00:08:34.320
I'm not gonna fail!

00:08:38.840 --> 00:08:41.170
Wear these and you'll become a Ragnan!

00:08:41.760 --> 00:08:43.410
Buy some for yourself!

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:46.840
Ragnans are a seafaring folk, they say.

00:08:49.530 --> 00:08:51.970
Ew! What's this icky thing!?

00:08:51.970 --> 00:08:53.420
It's cheap! Buy one!

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:56.050
It's a phone! Cell! Number one!

00:08:58.390 --> 00:08:59.730
A phone?

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:05.900
Contract established. Commence payment process.

00:09:07.160 --> 00:09:09.100
Get it off me!

00:09:09.100 --> 00:09:11.030
Thanks for your purchase!

00:09:11.030 --> 00:09:11.880
Time to run!

00:09:11.880 --> 00:09:12.690
Huh?

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:21.150
Cities are so scary.

00:09:26.880 --> 00:09:27.870
Look at that.

00:09:30.980 --> 00:09:33.880
Oh my gosh, it's so big!

00:09:34.320 --> 00:09:38.080
That's the Macross Elysion, Chaos' Ragna branch's HQ.

00:09:38.080 --> 00:09:41.350
So they hold the auditions there?

00:09:42.880 --> 00:09:44.560
My rune's running high!

00:09:45.370 --> 00:09:47.830
Rune? You mean that tentacle thing on your head?

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:50.270
Don't stare at it, you perv!

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:53.260
Huh? It's supposed to be arousing?

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:59.910
The long-awaited audition for the new Walkure member are finally here!

00:10:00.130 --> 00:10:04.830
The chosen girls are gathering here at the feet of Macross Elysion.

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:08.790
Will one of them become a goddess?

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:14.450
So many cuties.

00:10:14.450 --> 00:10:16.720
Can't we just let them all in?

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:22.230
Do they really understand what it means to sing on the battlefield?

00:10:24.610 --> 00:10:28.130
What do you mean I can't enter the audition?!

00:10:28.130 --> 00:10:31.770
As I said, today is the final round.

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:33.900
You'd need to pass the qualifier rounds first.

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:35.090
There's qualifiers?

00:10:39.780 --> 00:10:41.250
Are you for real?

00:10:41.250 --> 00:10:43.120
What are you doing here?

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:46.950
Oh, hey, it's dancer boy.

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:49.120
Are you here to complain about me?

00:10:50.320 --> 00:10:51.950
The world isn't all about you.

00:10:54.050 --> 00:10:55.670
You're from the Delta platoon!

00:10:55.670 --> 00:10:58.770
Please let me take the audition!

00:10:58.770 --> 00:10:59.870
Huh?

00:10:59.870 --> 00:11:02.720
They've both arrived.

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:06.230
What are the qualifying requirements?

00:11:06.950 --> 00:11:09.060
She's cleared them on paper.

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:10.440
For crying out loud...

00:11:10.440 --> 00:11:12.900
Please! Give me an audition!

00:11:10.780 --> 00:11:12.900
Ah, right. In that case...

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:15.960
Please! Audition!

00:11:13.170 --> 00:11:17.190
Um, miss? You've received special permission

00:11:17.190 --> 00:11:21.340
to take part in the audition.

00:11:22.450 --> 00:11:24.620
Really?

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:26.280
So damn lucky.

00:11:26.280 --> 00:11:27.330
And also...

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:30.470
Are you Hayate Immelmann?

00:11:30.470 --> 00:11:31.850
I am.

00:11:31.850 --> 00:11:35.130
Commander Arad from the Delta platoon wants to see you.

00:11:35.410 --> 00:11:36.540
The commander?

00:11:38.320 --> 00:11:39.340
Me?

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:50.910
Gee whiz, that's a deculture and a half!

00:11:50.910 --> 00:11:52.480
It certainly is big.

00:11:53.030 --> 00:11:54.080
Hayate?

00:11:54.080 --> 00:11:55.380
Take care, then.

00:11:55.380 --> 00:11:56.440
Hey, wait!

00:11:57.360 --> 00:11:58.890
Um, thanks for—

00:11:58.890 --> 00:12:01.370
I'm not giving you a ride back home.

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:05.870
Once you're done failing, you're on your own.

00:12:07.060 --> 00:12:08.120
I'm not gonna fail!

00:12:08.250 --> 00:12:10.870
I can fly if I ride the wind!

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:20.210
<i>Aren't you the one taking this too lightly?</i>

00:12:21.710 --> 00:12:23.050
Damn kid!

00:12:37.720 --> 00:12:39.100
I can fly if I ride the wind.

00:12:39.210 --> 00:12:40.630
I can fly if I ride the wind.

00:12:40.630 --> 00:12:41.980
I can fly if I ride the wi—

00:12:50.520 --> 00:12:51.320
What's going on?

00:12:51.320 --> 00:12:53.300
I'm gonna get eaten!

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:55.430
Wow! It's Kaname!

00:12:55.430 --> 00:12:56.730
Oh my gosh! It's her for real!

00:12:56.730 --> 00:13:02.010
I'm the leader of the tactical sound unit Walkure, Kaname Buccaneer.

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:03.180
And with me here...

00:13:03.180 --> 00:13:08.100
Ernest Johnson, the captain of Macross Elysion.

00:13:09.820 --> 00:13:12.730
We will begin the auditions now.

00:13:13.780 --> 00:13:15.590
However, before that...

00:13:16.670 --> 00:13:20.060
Remember that we Walkure risk our lives during each performance.

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:23.460
If you're not willing to take that risk, please leave now.

00:13:23.460 --> 00:13:24.280
That's all.

00:13:26.940 --> 00:13:28.410
I'm so nervous!

00:13:28.410 --> 00:13:30.240
She said we're gonna risk our lives...

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:31.950
What are these?

00:13:32.320 --> 00:13:34.660
I think they're for recording our singing, or something.

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:36.520
Really? Let's do our best then!

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:38.880
That's her!

00:13:39.320 --> 00:13:43.630
All right! I'm gonna show them the Windermerean spirit!

00:13:43.630 --> 00:13:45.340
What? You lost him?!

00:13:45.550 --> 00:13:47.840
I'm so sorry!

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:49.630
DGS status normal.

00:13:49.630 --> 00:13:51.030
Hand me the wrench, will ya?

00:13:51.030 --> 00:13:52.240
Yeah, yeah.

00:13:54.180 --> 00:13:55.230
Who's that?

00:13:56.380 --> 00:13:59.120
That's a new face. You a rookie?

00:13:59.780 --> 00:14:01.980
Kind of.

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:17.250
<i>S.O.S. is echoing around</i>

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:20.130
<i>Love's halation THE WAR</i>

00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:22.880
<i>For sure, now, there's more</i>

00:14:22.880 --> 00:14:25.710
<i>More, now, hold me tight</i>

00:14:25.710 --> 00:14:28.470
<i>Hold me tight, hey, gently</i>

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:31.490
Checking for fold receptor activity...

00:14:32.570 --> 00:14:34.980
Only four girls...

00:14:34.980 --> 00:14:36.310
What about that girl?

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:38.440
She has it too, but the values are lower than required.

00:14:38.620 --> 00:14:40.700
She must be nervous.

00:14:43.350 --> 00:14:45.520
You're a Windermerean, right?

00:14:45.520 --> 00:14:46.930
Yes, ma'am.

00:14:46.930 --> 00:14:51.820
I heard that Windermere is very strict on interstellar travel since the revolution.

00:14:52.480 --> 00:14:58.580
Also that they've started cracking down on terrestrial culture.

00:14:58.580 --> 00:15:02.290
You might never be allowed to return home if you join Walkure.

00:15:03.730 --> 00:15:07.420
I'd still want to become a member of Walkure!

00:15:10.320 --> 00:15:12.650
I will announce the results of the third Walkure auditions.

00:15:16.250 --> 00:15:17.100
Everyone...

00:15:21.110 --> 00:15:22.270
has failed.

00:15:27.050 --> 00:15:30.240
You showed off some impressive moves the other day.

00:15:31.110 --> 00:15:34.880
I'm the commander of the Delta platoon, Arad Molders.

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:37.160
I was taken down in a flash.

00:15:38.360 --> 00:15:41.050
It was my first time flying a plane.

00:15:41.050 --> 00:15:44.690
But you seemed proficient at controlling a battroid.

00:15:44.690 --> 00:15:46.850
I've used workroids for work.

00:15:47.410 --> 00:15:49.030
I see.

00:15:49.030 --> 00:15:51.130
You seem to move around a lot.

00:15:52.240 --> 00:15:57.690
Listania. Ebel. Gregor. Different jobs on every planet.

00:15:57.690 --> 00:15:58.470
So what?

00:16:00.260 --> 00:16:02.240
Commander Arad, this is a waste of time.

00:16:02.240 --> 00:16:03.220
Hold on now.

00:16:03.890 --> 00:16:07.750
You're the one who asked for me.

00:16:07.750 --> 00:16:09.310
Who do you think...

00:16:09.310 --> 00:16:14.620
Well, I thought you could fly for us if you felt like it.

00:16:27.350 --> 00:16:29.280
I wonder if he's still inside.

00:16:30.620 --> 00:16:33.250
How did flying feel?

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:36.940
Come here.

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:42.860
If you fall, you die. You risk your life.

00:16:42.860 --> 00:16:44.910
But you still take off.

00:16:44.910 --> 00:16:48.340
That's the fate of those who've tasted the wind.

00:16:49.920 --> 00:16:52.240
You've tasted it too, haven't you?

00:16:52.830 --> 00:16:55.420
The rest is whether you fly or not,

00:16:56.330 --> 00:16:59.130
whether you're willing to risk your life.

00:17:08.410 --> 00:17:09.130
We stopped?

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:10.290
What happened?

00:17:12.430 --> 00:17:14.470
To all passengers:

00:17:14.470 --> 00:17:17.830
A Var riot has broken out in Barrette city.

00:17:17.830 --> 00:17:19.150
A Var outbreak?!

00:17:19.150 --> 00:17:20.350
Look at this!

00:17:20.730 --> 00:17:22.850
More and more people are affected by the Var.

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:24.870
The citizens are in a panic.

00:17:25.940 --> 00:17:27.310
That's awful!

00:17:27.450 --> 00:17:29.660
What are the Walkure doing?

00:17:32.600 --> 00:17:34.930
What's wrong? Are you okay?

00:17:51.650 --> 00:17:53.210
It's the Var syndrome!

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:54.820
What's going on? What's this?!

00:17:54.820 --> 00:17:55.920
Help! Help!

00:17:56.140 --> 00:17:58.360
What are you doing?! Come here!

00:18:16.080 --> 00:18:18.510
<i>Why am I here?</i>

00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:24.620
To sing...

00:18:30.260 --> 00:18:31.340
To sing...

00:18:35.760 --> 00:18:41.180
<i>Switch into gear... Screaming... No stopping now</i>

00:18:43.140 --> 00:18:49.690
<i>Switch into gear! Screaming! No stopping now</i>

00:18:50.900 --> 00:18:55.020
<i>S.O.S. the sirens are howling</i>

00:18:51.400 --> 00:18:52.660
What is she doing?

00:18:52.660 --> 00:18:54.010
Is she nuts?

00:18:55.020 --> 00:18:58.850
<i>Love's halation THE WAR</i>

00:18:59.560 --> 00:19:05.620
<i>My own story begins as I wake up</i>

00:19:06.250 --> 00:19:14.440
<i>This morning feels different. I rub my eyes</i>

00:19:11.470 --> 00:19:13.170
Risk my life, huh?

00:19:14.440 --> 00:19:17.100
<i>Ready to fire! Three, two</i>

00:19:17.100 --> 00:19:21.280
<i>onepiece flying as I spin</i>

00:19:21.280 --> 00:19:26.460
<i>My engine is now in extreme speed</i>

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:31.520
<i>Then we crash and a galactic level</i>

00:19:31.520 --> 00:19:35.020
<i>Boom comes for your deculture!</i>

00:19:35.020 --> 00:19:41.030
<i>All power starboard! I'm setting you on fire</i>

00:19:41.480 --> 00:19:48.450
<i>Feel it? Diving! There's no turning back</i>

00:19:48.820 --> 00:19:52.910
<i>S.O.S. the signal's on fire</i>

00:19:52.910 --> 00:19:57.180
<i>Love's changing THE WORLD</i>

00:19:57.680 --> 00:19:59.240
What are those numbers?

00:20:03.940 --> 00:20:05.390
You've got guts.

00:20:05.590 --> 00:20:07.130
He rode the wind?

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:12.960
That felt nice.

00:20:17.850 --> 00:20:18.680
This is yours.

00:20:22.190 --> 00:20:23.970
It's important to you, isn't it?

00:20:24.790 --> 00:20:26.210
I know your voice.

00:20:28.020 --> 00:20:30.520
Welcome to the world of Walkure.

00:20:39.880 --> 00:20:41.170
Mikumo?

00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:43.660
What's going on?

00:20:43.660 --> 00:20:45.810
This is the final audition.

00:20:45.810 --> 00:20:49.370
Your voice earlier resonated in my chest. It felt nice.

00:20:49.370 --> 00:20:51.890
You pass, Freyja Wion.

00:20:52.390 --> 00:20:53.630
I pass?!

00:20:58.040 --> 00:20:58.820
What is this?

00:20:59.150 --> 00:21:00.550
As of today, you're one

00:21:00.550 --> 00:21:01.530
of the Walkure.

00:21:03.080 --> 00:21:04.210
I'm one of...

00:21:04.880 --> 00:21:05.990
the Walkure?

00:21:06.210 --> 00:21:07.080
Congratulations!

00:21:07.080 --> 00:21:08.610
Sorry for scaring you!

00:21:08.610 --> 00:21:09.950
Good job, girl!

00:21:11.280 --> 00:21:13.660
You were at the audition's entry counter!

00:21:14.830 --> 00:21:17.330
That was quite impressive.

00:21:17.330 --> 00:21:19.340
Sorry. It's fake blood.

00:21:19.900 --> 00:21:23.180
Just as you predicted, Kumokumo.

00:21:23.180 --> 00:21:25.460
I feel a bit let down, though.

00:21:31.570 --> 00:21:33.730
I flew...

00:21:34.840 --> 00:21:37.700
I can't believe this is happening.

00:21:41.630 --> 00:21:43.120
I hate the army.

00:21:43.650 --> 00:21:44.730
So do I.

00:21:45.260 --> 00:21:47.010
Taking orders too.

00:21:47.790 --> 00:21:50.280
So I'll play by my own rules.

00:21:50.580 --> 00:21:51.820
Feel free to.

00:21:51.820 --> 00:21:53.120
Commander Arad?

00:21:55.050 --> 00:21:58.280
I'll fly the skies with this beauty.

00:21:58.280 --> 00:21:59.000
Get away from her!

00:22:01.680 --> 00:22:04.840
Don't you lay a finger on my plane!

00:22:04.840 --> 00:22:06.840
Mission 02: Audition with Death

00:22:07.200 --> 00:22:08.680
Are you ready now?

00:22:19.600 --> 00:22:26.860
<i>I heard a gossip saying the world's gonna end someday</i>

00:22:26.860 --> 00:22:32.370
<i>Just kidding, that's so obvious</i>

00:22:34.040 --> 00:22:37.710
<i>I remember looking up at the sky</i>

00:22:37.710 --> 00:22:41.420
<i>and feeling like I was in the future</i>

00:22:41.420 --> 00:22:47.020
<i>I felt completely in sync with your wind</i>

00:22:48.980 --> 00:22:56.020
<i>I finally found a place where I could be a girl</i>

00:22:56.020 --> 00:23:03.520
<i>so I've got no choice but to do it. I can't stop now!</i>

00:23:03.520 --> 00:23:05.110
You better be ready!

00:23:05.110 --> 00:23:08.700
<i>If my rune shines with a flash</i>

00:23:08.700 --> 00:23:12.450
<i>(wow wow wowow)</i>

00:23:12.450 --> 00:23:15.940
<i>I fall in love</i>

00:23:15.940 --> 00:23:19.410
<i>(wow wow wowow)</i>

00:23:19.800 --> 00:23:24.960
<i>Lalali lalala it's your fault</i>

00:23:27.140 --> 00:23:32.750
<i>Lalala I feel peerless when my rune flashes{fuck this shit}</i>

00:23:36.810 --> 00:23:40.020
Next time: A Stormy Dogfight
